sequenceDiagram
    %% praxis-grid data flows (Flows 1-4 from praxis-grid.md)
    autonumber
    participant Admin as Admin / grid-admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Op as grid-operator (leader)<br/>9090/TCP, 9091/TCP mTLS, 7946/UDP
    participant Peer as Peer grid-operator<br/>7946/UDP, 9091/TCP mTLS
    participant Prov as Inference providers<br/>provider-defined port
    participant Sync as grid-overlay-sync<br/>sidecar
    participant GW as Praxis AI gateway<br/>consumer / final-hop
    participant Client as External client
    participant Enr as enrollment<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over Admin,PG: Flow 4 - Site enrollment
    Admin->>Enr: POST /v1alpha1/enrollmenttokens<br/>Bearer → TokenReview + SAR
    Enr->>K8s: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>(virtual grid.praxis.fast/enrollmenttokens)
    Enr-->>Admin: One-time enrollment token
    Op->>Enr: POST /v1alpha1/enrollments (CSR)<br/>TLS, one-time token
    Enr->>PG: Store enrollment / CSR record<br/>TLS, SCRAM password
    Enr-->>Op: Signed SPIFFE site certificate
    Op->>K8s: Write grid-site-identity Secret
    Op->>Enr: POST /v1alpha1/rotations (renewal)<br/>Site credential
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
    Note over Admin,PG: Flow 1 - Routing overlay publication (control plane)
    Op->>K8s: Watch GridNetwork, GridSite,<br/>InferenceProvider, AgentToolProvider<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    Op->>Prov: Health, GET /v1/models, metrics<br/>TLS 1.2+ when HTTPS<br/>Bearer from Secret / TokenRequest token / none
    Prov-->>Op: Health, models, queue depth / KV-cache
    Op->>K8s: Write routing overlay + serving ConfigMaps
    Sync->>K8s: Watch overlay ConfigMap<br/>TLS 1.2+, SA token
    K8s-->>Sync: Overlay envelope
    Sync->>Sync: Validate content-addressed envelope
    Sync->>GW: Atomic write to shared emptyDir<br/>(pod-local file)
    GW->>GW: Hot reload overlay
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 230)
    Note over Admin,PG: Flow 2 - Cross-site membership and signals
    Op->>Peer: SWIM gossip 7946/UDP<br/>AES-256-GCM, shared mesh key<br/>(no per-site origin binding)
    Peer-->>Op: Membership + provider CRDT deltas
    Op->>Peer: GET /v1/site/signals, /v1/site/providers<br/>9091/TCP mTLS (TLS 1.2+, EMS)<br/>SPIFFE site certificate
    Peer-->>Op: Peer provider signals
    GW->>Op: POST /v1/site/signals/ingest<br/>9091/TCP mTLS, local gateway cert only
    end

    rect rgb(255, 238, 238)
    Note over Admin,PG: Flow 3 - Inference request (data plane, operator not in path)
    Client->>GW: HTTPS 443/TCP<br/>External caller auth (edge-owned)
    GW->>GW: Consumer → provider gateway hop<br/>mTLS, AGN site cert (peer_identity_trust)
    GW->>Prov: HTTPS, TLS<br/>Authorization: Bearer injected by credential_inject
    Prov-->>GW: Inference response
    GW-->>Client: Response
    end
